-#
  DSP-05, DSP-02: the map, opened on the site in focus or on Riga, and the
  markers with their details; the map controller draws them. The map itself
  stays when a refresh changes the markers (DYN-12); the page is never kept in
  Turbo's cache, whose copy would hold the old map.
- small = local_assigns.fetch(:small, false)
- turbo_exempts_page_from_cache
- content_for(:head) do
  = stylesheet_link_tag "/vendor/maplibre-gl-6.11.2/maplibre-gl.css"
.map-view{ class: ("map-small" if small),
  data: { controller: "map",
          map_tiles_value: "/tiles/#{map}",
          map_pmtiles_value: "/vendor/pmtiles-4.5.0/pmtiles.js",
          map_attribution_value: map_credit,
          map_center_value: (focus&.position || MapsHelper::RIGA).to_json,
          map_zoom_value: focus ? 15 : 11,
          map_open_value: (dom_id(focus.site, :map) if focus && !small),
          map_interactive_value: (!small).to_s } }
  .map-canvas{ id: small ? "site-map-canvas" : "map-canvas", data: { map_target: "canvas", turbo_permanent: true } }
  %ul.map-sites{ hidden: true }
    - markers.each do |marker|
      = render "maps/marker", marker:
